        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 25 at 5:48PM PDT until September 25 at 11:00PM PDT by NWS Portland OR</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...For the first Small Craft Advisory, seas 7 to 9 ft at 9
seconds and northwest winds 10 to 15 kt. For the second Small
Craft Advisory, seas 5 to 8 ft at 8 seconds and north winds 10
to 20 kt with gusts up to 25 kt expected.

* WHERE...Coastal waters from Cape Falcon to Cape Foulweather OR
out 10 NM and Waters from Cape Falcon to Cape Foulweather OR
from 10 to 60 NM.

* WHEN...Small Craft Advisory, until 11 PM PDT this evening.
Small Craft Advisory, from 2 PM Saturday to 5 AM PDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
